    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc98CHECK THIS OUT!\ud83d\udc98</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777390/extras/9aae76fbda508c40109327bad312210d.avif?t=1730718129\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777390/extras/02dc79e5282038ea1a3ed735b4a47ff5.poster.avif?t=1730718129\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777390/extras/02dc79e5282038ea1a3ed735b4a47ff5.webm?t=1730718129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777390/extras/02dc79e5282038ea1a3ed735b4a47ff5.mp4?t=1730718129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Experience living under the same roof with a robot girl!</h2><br>Manage your time between adventuring and enhancing your android in this brand-new sequel!<br>Through a twist of fate, you managed to free Nova, an irregular android, from the authorities, and now you live together! Solve mysteries, get employed, and uncover the secrets behind her mysterious past!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777390/extras/84a1ca37d7590b8ecbaa5cdfcc61af68.poster.avif?t=1730718129\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777390/extras/84a1ca37d7590b8ecbaa5cdfcc61af68.webm?t=1730718129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777390/extras/59b9ba420bd788ebb1f98e5b4942bf36.poster.avif?t=1730718129\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777390/extras/59b9ba420bd788ebb1f98e5b4942bf36.webm?t=1730718129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>The location which Nova and the main protagonist live in is the same with Aino\u2019s but sets in a different timeline. <br>Experiences with the first game is not required, you can still enjoy the sequel by itself !<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777390/extras/e922a912aaa0c53c9cb85a9cda4367d6.poster.avif?t=1730718129\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777390/extras/e922a912aaa0c53c9cb85a9cda4367d6.webm?t=1730718129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777390/extras/e922a912aaa0c53c9cb85a9cda4367d6.mp4?t=1730718129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777390/extras/93931bb1d62b8283d6165912f3e26f18.poster.avif?t=1730718129\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777390/extras/93931bb1d62b8283d6165912f3e26f18.webm?t=1730718129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777390/extras/93931bb1d62b8283d6165912f3e26f18.mp4?t=1730718129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777390/extras/08bdc466abe6462999575ddd4d83149b.poster.avif?t=1730718129\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777390/extras/08bdc466abe6462999